 "source": "OpenITI corpus (github.com/OpenITI), digital editions of Diwan al-Imam al-Shafi'i, Diwan al-Mutanabbi and Ibn al-Jawzi's Sayd al-Khatir. Text copied verbatim (unvocalized, source spellings kept) and verified by the reviewer thread; see review/data in the project files.",
